      "pattern": "只要 A，就 B",
      "explanation_en": "\"As long as A, then B\" — states the one condition that’s enough to guarantee the result.",
      "example_zh": "只要你努力，就一定能成功。",
      "example_en": "As long as you work hard, you will surely succeed."
    },
    {
      "pattern": "不管怎么样",
      "explanation_en": "\"No matter what\" — sets up a conclusion that holds true regardless of other factors already discussed.",
      "example_zh": "不管怎么样，他都会支持你的决定。",
      "example_en": "No matter what, he will support your decision."
    },
    {
      "pattern": "一旦 A，B",
      "explanation_en": "\"Once A happens, B\" — A is a trigger event, and B is the response that follows automatically.",
      "example_zh": "一旦发现问题，他们就会马上处理。",
      "example_en": "Once they find a problem, they deal with it right away."
    }
